      "writtenOn": "2019-10-31T15:56:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You can get these by gpio_get_name(enum gpio_signal).\n\nAs you log almost all gpio_set_level calls, you might as well create a wrapper?\n\n  static void set_gpio(enum gpio_signal s, int enable)\n  {\n    CPRINTS(\"%7s %s\", enable ? \"enable\" : \"disable\", gpio_get_name(s));\n    gpio_set_level(s, enable);\n  }",
      "range": {
